    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Draw a vertical line through O. The two lines cross the circle at A, B, C and D. Draw a vertical line through A. Draw a vertical line through B. Draw a horizontal line through C. Draw a horizontal line through D. These four lines make the square cell, with corners E, F, G and H.",
